# svcmgr instance DB
#
# <name> <binary> <config> [extra-args...]
#
# A leading '*' on <name> means:
#   - autostart at boot
#   - auto-restart if the process dies (supervision)
#
# The program is always launched as:  <binary> -c <config> [extra-args...]

# frp client, two instances with different configs
*frpc-main  /usr/local/bin/frpc           /etc/svcmgr/frpc/main.toml
frpc-alt    /usr/local/bin/frpc           /etc/svcmgr/frpc/alt.toml

# EasyTier, supervised
*et-main    /usr/local/bin/easytier-core  /etc/svcmgr/easytier/main.toml
